CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1789164233
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G10/18
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Cheltenham general hospital says Sarah
OL,6, Greene and Mike Smith had a comfortable
OL,7, night and their conditions are
OL,8, satisfactory after yesterday's crash.
OL,10,FThe TV presenters both had operations
OL,11,Flast night on their injuries sustained
OL,12,Fwhen their helicopter crashed near
OL,13,FGotherington in Gloucestershire.
OL,15,FSarah has two broken legs and a broken
OL,16,Farm; Mike was badly concussed and has a
OL,17,Fbroken ankle.
OL,19,FMike's sister has said he is likely
OL,20,Fto be in hospital for at least a week;
OL,21,FSarah will have to stay longer.
OL,23,D]CFrom 11-09-88   teletextarchive.com
